{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"439","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v10305","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"THE SEIJI(青空みどり)","creatorId":"vndb:s6401","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:542","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6401","name":"THE SEIJI(青空みどり)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:2419","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"THE SEIJI(青空みどり)","creatorId":"vndb:s6401","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:542","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6401","name":"THE SEIJI(青空みどり)","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:67157","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"SOUND DEKICHI","creatorId":"vndb:s7183","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3131","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7183","name":"SOUND DEKICHI","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:67158","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c39078","characterName":"安堂 麗奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c39078"},"originalCharacterName":"安堂 麗奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a nice body and smile, indisputably cute. Possesses the appearance of the ideal boys' have."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, her inner self is extremely jealous and possesses a strong desire to monopolize. On other hand, has a very fussy side. If she doesn't get to control every action of her lover, she cannot feel satisfied."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It can be said elegantly, she has an earnest side, but to gain her lover's heart, she is willing to do anything regardless of consequences."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"If there is a valid reason, then she won't reject even shameless acts. Therefore, she is easily deceived by people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There are no hobbies or enthusiasm over anything, just everything of her lover's. Academic ability is neither good or bad."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39078"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/1849dd99da7d341add88f3c1b1573acb2a2b0988c12b01ccea8155d1814d6f94.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74fce5a40fc9711eb7df92fa356580ead4107b56de582514eaaad0d4cc16759f.webp","width":105,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c39079","characterName":"榊原 美穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c39079"},"originalCharacterName":"榊原 美穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gives off a more sexy and adult like feeling than Reina."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Possesses a mature disposition, unimaginable from a student. Has a very understanding character, finds being jealous unpleasant and dislikes the troublesome relationships between men and women."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sexual curiosity is very unrestrained, due to which techniques are considerably polished."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Feels everything is transient and is not good at untiringly doing something."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is avoided by the normal school boys but is suitable for the men, who have confidence in sex. She, herself enjoys that thrill."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies include all sports in general. Especially, she is addicted to snowboarding. Also loves to dance. She is very bad at studying."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39079"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36a1cdd71e406cfb639fde5dab715009ee051e8cdfb37d9ffba3090aa9edc67d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e001bcc60eb5c8a5d21cbf77b630db397de80434f092ce036b50042e378616ee.webp","width":105,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c39080","characterName":"東丸 彩","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c39080"},"originalCharacterName":"東丸 彩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Doesn't stand out much, but gives a pretty cute impression. Due to a unmotivated personality, doesn't possess much presence, but if looked closely, she maybe cuter than Reina."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is always reading. Because she is always absorbed in her thoughts, it is difficult to what she is thinking currently. Judging by appearance alone, seems someone who is easy to be deceived but is actually quite formidable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although has not developed sexually, if she targets someone, she will bring them down definitely. Possesses a very tenacious character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Further, she is smart, even in Shogi can drive her opponent in corner, step by step."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies include everything that can satisfy her intellectual curiosity. Especially Shogi and Go. Her rank in results, do not fall under 3rd."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c39080"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2de66b08e0820f7cae3e12cdd5d027caadab10750d10fe16b2507d078ed31c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45cd22e5ed8b41a9f18752effd154261582b9f4aabfcc57ce1683f5a0239dfb4.webp","width":105,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1502","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:191","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1502","name":"DEEP ZONE","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:439:191","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1502","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1502","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1502","name":"Deep Zone","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:137386:v10305","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1502","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1502","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1502","name":"Deep Zone","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:24553:v10305","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1502","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1502","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1502","name":"Deep Zone","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:24554:v10305","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1502","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1502","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1502","name":"